["21:43"]={"\0039:43 P.M.\004\n“We’ll be working together, kid,” Dore Peretz was saying. “We’re a team.” He swept back his mane of salt-and-pepper hair, then moved next to Georges LeFarge.","Project Cyclops","Thomas Hoover"},
