["21:58"]={"Second to last, the inset clock blinks from 21:57 to \00321:58\004. Napier’s eyes sink, newborn sunshine slants through ancient oaks and on a lost river. Look, Joe, herons","Cloud Atlas","David Mitchell"},
["21:59"]={"At \003a minute to ten\004 the sky came alive with helicopter rotors. As at the Gala site, three choppers brought the potentates, Fortunato, no Enigma Babylon rep this time, and finally Carpathia.","Assassins","Tim LaHaye and Jerry B. Jenkins"},
